# Fullscreen display turned off and kept, from the main menu, with
# LbaWinFullScreen: 2 in lba.cfg (fixtures/fullscreen). Return turns the
# option menu's seventh entry OFF and writes 0 to lba.cfg, which the first
# entry leaves as it is. Keys are short, as in options.

hold 0.05
sleep 40
shot menu
key Down Down Return
sleep 3
shot on
key Down Down Down Down Down Down
sleep 1
key Return
sleep 2
shot off
key Up Up Up Up Up Up
sleep 1
key Return
sleep 3
shot main
